o — after this, I can potentially follow up with another pair or single, depending on peasant responses.\n- Saving the BlackJoker and Aces for later ensures I can win key tricks when needed, especially near the endgame.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♥6", "♣6"]}'}
